  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1788/941/dappas-png.png\" alt=\"yes\"></p>\n<h2>尝试 beta 版本 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/daffatheone/posts/daffas-beta-rpd-164599927\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Daffa's Arsenal 3.7.0 beta1 Patreon</a></h2>\n<h1>Kofi: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fdaffatheone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/daffatheone</a></h1>\n<h1>Paypal Me: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fDaffatheOne\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://paypal.me/DaffatheOne</a></h1>\n<p><strong>请务必安装 TACZ 才能使用此模组！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>请将 FOV（视野）设置为 90 以获得正确的准星位置！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>这是一个模组……请将其安装到 mods 文件夹中。</strong></p>\n<h3>感谢捐赠者：Sabastien, Antony, Monica</h3>\n<h1>介绍 Daffa's Arsenal</h1>\n<p>唯一一款能带来近乎最新《使命召唤》作品般令人满意的射击感的 TACZ 模组。</p>\n<p>yes</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KJVyPSFGFNA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/KJVyPSFGFNA/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"daffas1\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3NdvrUsqil4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/3NdvrUsqil4/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"daffas\"></a></p>\n<h1>武器列表</h1>\n<h3>HK-416</h3>\n<h3>以及更多武器</h3>\n<h1>配件列表</h1>\n<h3>以及更多配件</h3>\n<h1>致谢</h1>\n<h3>DaffaTheOne (枪械包)</h3>\n<h3>Corrineduck (编译器)</h3>",
